---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Stamp from '../components/Stamp.astro';
---

<Layout tone="career" title="Career" description="Lakshya Tiwari's work in product at FOLO and Niyo.">
  <article class="prose">
    <Stamp label="Career" date="Since Dec 2024" ink="var(--navy)" tilt={-4} />
    <h1>Onboarding, growth, and the first five minutes.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I work on the moments that decide whether someone sticks around. Right now that’s at FOLO;
      before that, forex cards at Niyo.
    </p>

    <h2>FOLO</h2>
    <p class="role">Associate Product Manager, founding team</p>
    <p>
      At FOLO I lead product for onboarding. We scaled from a closed beta of 5K users to 1.3L+
      users, and I’ve owned the journey every one of them goes through on day one.
    </p>
    <p>
      I set up our analytics infrastructure from scratch: BigQuery and Metabase dashboards for the
      product, plus API monitoring dashboards so we see problems before users do.
    </p>
    <p>
      The result: onboarding conversion up <strong>15%</strong>, and our stickiness ratio
      up <strong>4%</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>Niyo</h2>
    <p class="role">Product, forex cards</p>
    <p>Onboarding for Niyo’s forex cards, and the launch of Niyo Express.</p>
    <p class="muted">Full story coming soon.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  article > :global(.stamp) {
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
